text Route114_Text_MeteorFallsSign {
    format("METEOR FALLS RUSTBORO CITY THROUGH HERE")
}

text Route114_Text_LanettesHouse {
    format("LANETTE'S HOUSE")
}

text Route114_Text_FossilManiacsHouseSign {
    format("FOSSIL MANIAC'S HOUSE “Fossils gratefully accepted!”")
}


text Route114_Text_AngelinaDefeat {
    "Oh, I see.\nThat's good to know."
}

text Route114_Text_AngelinaIntro {
    "Have you made your POKéMON evolve\nvery much?"
}

text Route114_Text_AngelinaPostBattle {
    "Some POKéMON change so much when\nthey evolve, it's startling!"
}

text Route114_Text_BernieDefeat {
    "Thanks for dousing my fire!"
}

text Route114_Text_BernieIntro {
    "If you're lighting a campfire,\nmake sure you have water handy."
}

text Route114_Text_BerniePostBattle {
    "You really do have to be careful with\nany sort of fire in a forest.\pDon't ever underestimate the power\nof fire."
}

text Route114_Text_CharlotteDefeat {
    "That wasn't cute in the least!"
}

text Route114_Text_CharlotteIntro {
    "Me!\nI'm not just a pretty face!"
}

text Route114_Text_CharlottePostBattle {
    "I don't want a POKéMON that's\njust cute.\pI adore cute ones that have a quirk\nor two!"
}

text Route114_Text_ClaudeDefeat {
    "If we were fishing, I would've won…"
}

text Route114_Text_ClaudeIntro {
    "If we were fishing, you wouldn't stand\na chance against me.\nSo, bring on your POKéMON!"
}

text Route114_Text_ClaudePostBattle {
    "I think I'll try my luck at landing\na big one at METEOR FALLS.\pThere has to be something in there.\nI just know it."
}

text Route114_Text_KaiDefeat {
    "What was that about?\nDid mine lose in size?"
}

text Route114_Text_KaiIntro {
    "I landed a big one!\nA huge one, I tell you!"
}

text Route114_Text_KaiPostBattle {
    "Okay!\nI'll just fish me a bigger one!"
}

text Route114_Text_LennyDefeat {
    "Yodelayhihoo!"
}

text Route114_Text_LennyIntro {
    "Yodelayhihoo!\p… …\pYou're supposed to shout\n“yodelayhihoo” since it doesn't\necho here!"
}

text Route114_Text_LennyPostBattle {
    "When I was a wee tyke, I believed there\nwas someone copying me and shouting\nback, “Yodelayhihoo.”"
}

text Route114_Text_LucasDefeat {
    "The mountains are unforgiving…"
}

text Route114_Text_LucasIntro {
    "If you're not prepared, you shouldn't\nbe up in the mountains!"
}

text Route114_Text_LucasPostBattle {
    "In the winter, mountains turn deadly\nwith blizzards and avalanches."
}

text Route114_Text_NancyDefeat {
    "Oh, no!"
}

text Route114_Text_NancyIntro {
    "I need to exercise after a meal.\nLet's have a match!"
}

text Route114_Text_NancyPostBattle {
    "I just had a tasty meal.\nI'm getting drowsy…"
}

text Route114_Text_NolanDefeat {
    "I like to battle, but that doesn't\nmean I'm good at it…"
}

text Route114_Text_NolanIntro {
    "I like to fish. But I also like to\nbattle!\pIf anyone challenges me, I'm there,\neven if I'm fishing."
}

text Route114_Text_NolanPostBattle {
    "This time I'll do it!\pI always think that, so I can't walk\naway from fishing or POKéMON."
}

text Route114_Text_ShaneDefeat {
    "Way too strong!"
}

text Route114_Text_ShaneIntro {
    "Camping's fun! You can fish, roast\nmarshmallows, and tell spooky stories!\pBut the best of all are the POKéMON\nbattles!"
}

text Route114_Text_ShanePostBattle {
    "I think it's great that I can go\ncamping with my POKéMON."
}

text Route114_Text_SteveDefeat {
    "M-My POKéMON…"
}

text Route114_Text_SteveIntro {
    "Ufufufufufu…\nWant to battle against my POKéMON?"
}

text Route114_Text_StevePostBattle {
    "A big body that's all lumpy and hard,\nenormous horns, and vicious fangs…\pUfufufufu…\nI wish I had a POKéMON like that…"
}